  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"663da224-39d7-4c13-8154-e155dc2aaffc\">\n  <p class=\"poem\"><strong>Hast thou no scar?<br>No hidden scar on foot, or side, or hand?<br>I hear thee sung as mighty in the land,<br>I hear them hail thy bright ascendant star:<br>Hast thou no scar?</strong></p>\n  <p class=\"poem\"><strong>Hast thou no wound?<br>Yet, I was wounded by the archers, spent.<br>Leaned me against the tree to die, and rent<br>By ravening beasts that compassed me, I swooned:<br>Hast thou no wound?</strong></p>\n  <p class=\"poem\"><strong>No wound? No scar?<br>Yes, as the master shall the servant be,<br>And pierced are the feet that follow Me;<br>But thine are whole. Can he have followed far<br>Who has no wound? No scar?</strong></p>\n  <p><strong>Amy Carmichael</strong></p>\n</article>\n",
